<title>BELGIUM: Belgian govt sets 80 bln bfr '97 austerity package.</title>
<headline>Belgian govt sets 80 bln bfr '97 austerity package.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's 1997 budget will contain a total 80 billion Belgian francs austerity package, the government said in a policy statement on the budget.</p>
<p>The 1997 package compares with 1996's set of measures worth over 110 billion francs.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
